# Handler matrix

**Audience:** experienced Rocci author.
**Prerequisites:** [runtime reference](/docs/reference/runtime/).
**Role:** exhaustive handler contract, not a beginner tutorial.

One standalone app that lists every accepted handler construct. Fragment
handlers return uniquely identified HTML fragments. Commands return no
representation. `@get:live("/events/matrix")` owns `#live-tick` so the stream
never races a one-shot fragment.

This catalog row is **docs-only**. Do not expose it as a public origin; use
local `curl` against `rocci run`.

See [source](/examples/handler-matrix/source/).

## Run locally

```sh
cargo run -q -p rocci-cli -- run examples/rocci/standalone/handler-matrix/HandlerMatrix.rocci
```

## Smoke

```sh
curl -s http://127.0.0.1:8000/health
curl -s -X POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/actions/post-frag
curl -s -X POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/actions/post-cmd
```
